<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>I’ve seen how they,</l><l>Pierced Your side,</l><l>You gave Your all,</l><l>To win Your bride</l><l>J-E-S-U-S, I love You.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Without Your love, Lord,</l><l>I’m so empty</l><l>Life has no meaning;</l><l>Just vanity,</l><l>J-E-S-U-S, Reality.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Jesus in me.</l><l>What a wonder;</l><l>Bubbling over,</l><l>Living water.</l><l>J-E-S-U-S, What a joy!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
